{"name":"Prairiecore","title":"Prairiecore","revision":232060,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Prairiecore","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Interests"},{"kind":"list","text":"Baking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Candle making"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dancing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Farming"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hanging out with animals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Horseback riding"},{"kind":"list","text":"Picnicking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Playing string instruments"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sewing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Swimming"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"Anything with ruffled sleeves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blouses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Floral pattern"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Bottoms"},{"kind":"list","text":"High waist pants"},{"kind":"list","text":"Long skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Paperbag pants"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Aprons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bonnets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Earrings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gloves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Handbags"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lockets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Parasols"},{"kind":"list","text":"Straw Hats"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Midi dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Prairie dresses"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Shoes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Booties"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heeled mules"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace up boots"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Stores"},{"kind":"list","text":"Christy Dawn"},{"kind":"list","text":"DÔEN"},{"kind":"list","text":"Free People"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gunne Sax (no longer in production)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Laura Ashley"},{"kind":"list","text":"Meadows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shabby Chic"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Miscellaneous"},{"kind":"list","text":"Calico"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plaid patterns"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Although this aesthetic has regained popularity since the late 2010's, it initially emerged in the 1970's. Much of the related media, usually television, is from the 1970's. Family shows like Little House on the Prairie, The Waltons, and some Western films are a part of it. The stories are in the same area, with the main characters growing older and learning about life while living through an 1800s era on a farm."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Genres"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blue Grass"},{"kind":"list","text":"Country"},{"kind":"list","text":"Americana"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"Emmy-Lou Harris"},{"kind":"list","text":"First-Aid Kit"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mumford and Sons (2009-2013)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Chicks"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Civil Wars"},{"kind":"list","text":"Trampled By Turtles"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Songs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Coney Island (ft. the National) by Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"Exile (ft. Bon Iver) by Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"Evermore (ft. Bon Iver) by Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"Safe and Sound (ft. The Civil Wars) by Taylor Swift"},{"kind":"list","text":"Top of the World by The Chicks"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/5/5c/Prarie.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200729230252","caption":"Prarie","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prarie.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0803-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/8/8d/Prairiefarm.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20200730151054","caption":"Prairiecore · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Prairiefarm.j